    cnw:editorialNote "\"Choral før Talen\" is an arrangement of the hymn \"Hvo ikkun lader Herren raade\" (If Thou but Suffer God to Guide Thee), and \"Efter Talen\" an arrangement of a tune by H.O.C. Zinck (1801)." ;
